<thead>
<tr>
<th>Approximate section</th>
<th>Spoken purpose</th>
<th>Visual plan</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Opening, 0:00=E2=80=930:25</td>
<td>State question and give one concrete reason to care</td>
<td>Talking head plus the actual project finish line</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Context, 0:25=E2=80=931:00</td>
<td>Explain the constraint and test</td>
<td>Calendar with private details removed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Method, 1:00=E2=80=932:00</td>
<td>Define output and start rule</td>
<td>Overhead notebook; three simple labels</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Attempts, 2:00=E2=80=933:30</td>
<td>Show what happened</td>
<td>Actual work clips and dated log</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Complication, 3:30=E2=80=934:30</td>
