 output before another course. Write the viewer and the action.</li>
<li><strong>10=E2=80=9325:</strong> Adapt the R sample into six speaking ca=
rds. Remove anything that does not match your beliefs or experience.</li>
<li><strong>25=E2=80=9340:</strong> Set up the phone by a window. Make and =
review a short audio/image test.</li>
<li><strong>40=E2=80=9360:</strong> Record the opening and body in sections=
. Restart sentences when needed.</li>
